  <diagram name="Page-1" id="T_Txx3Xaxb4ICrfqFrLV">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3285" dy="957" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n  RoundCorner 10\n  FontSize 11\n  FontColor #1A2235\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n  Color #7C3AED\n  FontColor #7C3AED\n  FontSize 10\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName DM Sans\n\ntitle Dlib Face Recognition Pipeline\n\n&#39; ── Input ─────────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Input**\\nBase64 Image\\n(from browser / gate camera)\&quot; as Input #EDE0FF\n\n&#39; ── Stage 1 ───────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Stage 1 — Detection**\\nDlib HOG Face Detector\\nReturns face bounding box\&quot; as S1 #F5EEFF\n\n&#39; ── Stage 2 ───────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Stage 2 — Landmark Detection**\\nShape Predictor Model\\n68 facial landmark points\&quot; as S2 #F5EEFF\n\n&#39; ── Stage 3 ───────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Stage 3 — Encoding**\\nResNet Face Recognition Model\\n128-d float64 embedding\&quot; as S3 #F5EEFF\n\n&#39; ── Stage 4 ───────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Stage 4 — Comparison**\\nEuclidean Distance vs all stored\\nembeddings (sequential scan)\&quot; as S4 #F5EEFF\n\n&#39; ── Two Modes ─────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Enrollment Mode**\\nStore embedding as\\nBLOB in users table\\n(1024 bytes / user)\&quot; as Enroll #C8F0DC\n\nrectangle \&quot;**Recognition Mode**\\nFind min distance match\\nThreshold &lt; 0.5 = Match\\nReturn user_id + confidence\&quot; as Recog #FFE0D0\n\n&#39; ── Result ────────────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Match Found**\\nGenerate JWT Tokens\\nor Log Attendance\&quot; as Match #D6E4FF\n\nrectangle \&quot;**No Match**\\n401 Unauthorized\\nor Log Failed Attempt\&quot; as NoMatch #FFD0D0\n\n&#39; ── Flow ──────────────────────────────────────────\nInput -down-&gt; S1\nS1    -down-&gt; S2 : Face detected\nS2    -down-&gt; S3 : 68 landmarks\nS3    -down-&gt; S4 : 128-d embedding\n\nS4    -down-&gt; Enroll : Enrollment\\nMode\nS4    -down-&gt; Recog  : Recognition\\nMode\n\nRecog -down-&gt; Match   : distance &lt; 0.5\nRecog -down-&gt; NoMatch : distance ≥ 0.5\n\n&#39; ── Failure paths ─────────────────────────────────\nS1 -right-&gt; NoMatch : No face\\ndetected\nS1 -left-&gt;  NoMatch : Multiple faces\\ndetected\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="14pVjtuajESJFR7WagT--21">
